# Hitting the Marquisate (windurst 71): its Nanaa Mihgo lines next to Mihgo's Amigo's 89 (an Event; completed by GM,
# its mustZone char var set by GM). A THF at level 50, The Tenshodo Showdown and As Thick as Thieves completed: 512
# (Progress) over 89, begun; yatnielProg 2 and hagainProg 8 by GM: 516 over 89; 517 over 89.
lists WindurstWoods/Nanaa_Mihgo/onTrigger
char zone=WindurstWoods pos=66.5,-4.75,239.6 job=THF lvl=50
quest Windurst.MihgosAmigo completed
quest Windurst.TheTenshodoShowdown completed
quest Windurst.AsThickAsThieves completed
login
charvar Quest[2][25]mustZone 241               # GM: Mihgo's Amigo's completed 89 (an Event) at Nanaa Mihgo, 91 at Cha Lebagta
trigger Nanaa_Mihgo+99                         # 512 (Progress) over 89
finish                                         # begun
charvar Quest[2][71]yatnielProg 2              # GM
charvar Quest[2][71]hagainProg 8               # GM
trigger Nanaa_Mihgo+99                         # 516 over 89
finish                                         # nanaaProg 1, the others 0
trigger Nanaa_Mihgo+99                         # 517 over 89
finish
